          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "-- Stage deploys per time bucket ($granularity: auto/day/week/~month), grouped by project/team\nSELECT\n  $__timeGroupAlias(cdc.finished_date, $granularity),\n  COALESCE(pm.project_name, 'Unmapped') AS metric,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT cdc.cicd_deployment_id) AS value\nFROM cicd_deployment_commits cdc\nLEFT JOIN project_mapping pm\n  ON cdc.cicd_scope_id = pm.row_id AND pm.`table` = 'cicd_scopes'\nWHERE cdc.environment = 'STAGING'\n  AND pm.project_name IN ($project)\n  AND $__timeFilter(cdc.finished_date)\nGROUP BY 1, metric\nORDER BY 1",
